.el .ds Aq '
.TH hipfire-gpu-lock 1  "hipfire-gpu-lock " 
.SH NAME
hipfire\-gpu\-lock \- GPU mutex for multi\-agent coordination (acquire/release/status)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhipfire\-gpu\-lock\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
GPU mutex for multi\-agent coordination (acquire/release/status)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
hipfire\-gpu\-lock\-acquire(1)
Acquire the GPU lock (blocks until free). A detached holder keeps it until `release` or the calling shell exits
.TP
hipfire\-gpu\-lock\-release(1)
Release the GPU lock (SIGTERM the holder recorded in the lockfile)
.TP
hipfire\-gpu\-lock\-status(1)
Print lock status: "gpu is free" or "gpu BUSY: <holder>"
.TP
hipfire\-gpu\-lock\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
